  "description": "Personal life OS — gym, fuel, sport, DSA season, routines, tasks, money, drop & habits. Self-hosted on a laptop, on your phone over Tailscale.",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "concurrently -k -n api,web -c magenta,cyan \"tsx watch server/index.ts\" \"vite\"",
